<title>ITALY: Gross yield falls at Italy CTZ bill auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yield falls at Italy CTZ bill auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result for the 2.5 trillion lire auction of a third tranche of October 31, 1998 two-year Italian Treasury zero coupon certificates (CTZ).</p>
<p>			   Oct 31, 1998	Previous</p>
<p>Net Yield		  5.45 pct   vs    5.75 pct</p>
<p>Gross Yield		6.24 pct   vs    6.55 pct</p>
<p>Assigned price	  88.80	 vs   88.10</p>
<p>Bids			4.59 trillion lire</p>
<p>Assigned		  2.50 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparison is with a previous auction of a first tranche of October 31, 1998 Ctzs on October 28.</p>
</text>
